Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.17,0:00:02.80,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs37}"The Strongest Mega Evolution"...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.54,0:00:05.92,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs37}...is a story about Mega Evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:11.19,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs37}Alan, the assistant of Mega Evolution researcher Professor Platane,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.66,0:00:13.68,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs37}set off in search of Mega Stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.43,0:00:17.60,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs37}However, he couldn't attain the desired results.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.75,0:00:20.85,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs37}Just then, someone reached out his hand to Alan:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.47,0:00:25.52,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs37}Fleur-de-lis, who plans to use Mega Evolution energy for peaceful purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.19,0:00:32.07,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs37}Alan was entrusted a Mega Stone on the condition that he works with him on this plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:34.99,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs37}They then went to the Houen region,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:38.75,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs37}where their first course of action was to successfully retrieve...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:41.86,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs37}...the legendary megalith related to Mega Evolution energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.83,0:00:46.56,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs37}However, a single seed of doubt was planted in Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.17,0:00:54.74,Narrator,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,717)\fs37}That seed was the presence of the novice Trainer Manon, with whom he had been traveling since their coincidental meeting.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.46,0:01:20.00,MegaTitle,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1522,0)\fs25\pos(600,530)\c&H000000&}The Strongest Mega Evolution ~Act IV~
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.98,0:01:43.83,Warning,,0,0,0,,{\fad(528,480)\pos(640,40)}While watching anime, make sure not to sit too close to the screen and that the room is well lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.92,0:01:40.24,Woman1,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you watch the news about Kanazumi Bay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.24,0:01:43.02,Woman2,,0,0,0,,I sure did. You mean the legendary Pokémon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.20,0:01:47.57,Platane,,0,0,0,,Yo, Manon-kun. It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.35,0:01:49.31,Platane,,0,0,0,,Has something happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.03,0:01:51.08,Manon,,0,0,0,,Professor, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.95,0:01:53.58,Manon,,0,0,0,,You know a Trainer named Alan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.93,0:01:57.42,Manon,,0,0,0,,We traveled with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.69,0:01:58.38,Platane,,0,0,0,,With Alan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.64,0:01:59.50,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Hello, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:01.90,Platane,,0,0,0,,Daigo-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.78,0:02:03.25,Platane,,0,0,0,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.35,0:02:07.72,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Manon-kun, Alan-kun and I have been through some things together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.33,0:02:25.05,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Listen, Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.80,0:02:27.04,Alan,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.73,0:02:29.75,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,If you want to call yourself the strongest, win.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:31.85,Alan,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.39,0:02:35.31,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,You say you haven't fought enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:36.21,Alan,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.65,0:02:38.21,Alan,,0,0,0,,I'm still far from being the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.57,0:02:41.30,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Why are you in such a hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.81,0:02:43.01,Alan,,0,0,0,,I'm not in a hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.09,0:02:45.85,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.32,0:02:48.53,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Let me gather ten Mega Evolution users.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:49.95,Alan,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.95,0:02:50.48,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.61,0:02:52.88,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,...if you get defeated just once,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:55.94,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,I'll have you return the Mega Stone and the Key Stone to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:02:58.48,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,I don't need weaklings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.09,0:03:02.06,Alan,,0,0,0,,"If you want to fulfill your wish..."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.18,0:03:04.13,Alan,,0,0,0,,"...become the greatest."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.57,0:03:06.83,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Does it look like he'll win?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:08.37,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Pachira, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.41,0:03:10.66,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.76,0:03:14.21,Alan,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.93,0:03:15.39,Alan,,0,0,0,,...won't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.24,0:03:22.00,Alan,,0,0,0,,This is to protect what's important to me...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.18,0:03:32.41,FushigibanaTrainer,,0,0,0,,You're so unlucky...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.69,0:03:33.91,FushigibanaTrainer,,0,0,0,,...that I'm your first opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.43,0:03:35.09,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.74,0:03:38.40,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Continue the fight even if it means going beyond your limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.04,0:03:40.59,Alan,,0,0,0,,Let's do this, Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.77,0:03:48.12,FushigibanaTrainer,,0,0,0,,Fushigibana, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.61,0:03:55.33,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Why are you pushing him this far?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.90,0:03:57.47,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,You'll know when you fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.17,0:04:01.23,Pachira,,0,0,0,,If he makes it to the end at all, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.56,0:04:03.58,FushigibanaTrainer,,0,0,0,,Mega evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.63,0:04:23.05,Alan,,0,0,0,,Respond to my heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.05,0:04:23.94,Alan,,0,0,0,,Key Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:25.42,Alan,,0,0,0,,Surpass evolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:26.99,Alan,,0,0,0,,Mega evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.77,0:04:50.89,Alan,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.68,0:04:52.49,Alan,,0,0,0,,Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.77,0:05:10.53,FushigibanaTrainer,,0,0,0,,Now that it's mega evolved, Fire won't work on this guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.81,0:05:12.11,FushigibanaTrainer,,0,0,0,,Now! Venoshock!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.25,0:05:21.83,Alan,,0,0,0,,Poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.51,0:05:23.92,Pachira,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's over already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.65,0:05:25.01,Staff1,,0,0,0,,Director.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.47,0:05:26.67,Staff1,,0,0,0,,Some guests are here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.79,0:05:28.65,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:37.74,Manon,,0,0,0,,Whoa, so huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.16,0:05:39.98,Manon,,0,0,0,,I wonder what this huge ball is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.98,0:05:41.04,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.75,0:05:43.76,Manon,,0,0,0,,Fleur-de-lis-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.70,0:05:45.68,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.68,0:05:47.34,Manon,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but is Alan here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.60,0:05:48.22,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,He sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.65,0:05:49.36,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,He's battling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:52.00,Manon,,0,0,0,,May I go watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.33,0:05:53.26,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Let me show the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.50,0:05:54.24,Manon,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.63,0:05:56.29,Manon,,0,0,0,,What about you, Daigo-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.75,0:05:57.50,Daigo,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up with you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:05:58.37,Manon,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.93,0:06:01.45,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,This is about the megalith, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.78,0:06:15.52,Manon,,0,0,0,,Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:21.94,Alan,,0,0,0,,Never mind her! Worry about yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.54,0:06:23.37,FushigibanaTrainer,,0,0,0,,Swing it around!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.20,0:06:30.19,Alan,,0,0,0,,Get up, Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.86,0:06:36.06,FushigibanaTrainer,,0,0,0,,You still wanna continue...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.06,0:06:37.53,FushigibanaTrainer,,0,0,0,,In that case, use Seed Bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.14,0:06:41.23,Alan,,0,0,0,,Dragon Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.18,0:06:57.93,FushigibanaTrainer,,0,0,0,,Fushigibana!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.78,0:07:01.25,Manon,,0,0,0,,He won!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.41,0:07:05.13,Alan,,0,0,0,,Here's a Momon Berry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:06.30,Alan,,0,0,0,,Cure the poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.09,0:07:09.74,Manon,,0,0,0,,Hey, Alan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.65,0:07:13.04,FoodinTrainer,,0,0,0,,There's no time to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.37,0:07:15.66,FoodinTrainer,,0,0,0,,I'm rather impatient, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.73,0:07:19.08,FoodinTrainer,,0,0,0,,I intend to squash you. Be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.30,0:07:21.55,FoodinTrainer,,0,0,0,,Go, Foodin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.85,0:07:26.67,FoodinTrainer,,0,0,0,,Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.94,0:07:28.05,FoodinTrainer,,0,0,0,,Mega evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.29,0:07:44.78,Alan,,0,0,0,,Come on, this is only the second one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:46.21,Alan,,0,0,0,,Focus your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.31,0:07:54.86,FoodinTrainer,,0,0,0,,Psycho Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.01,0:08:01.08,Alan,,0,0,0,,Dragon Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.22,0:08:14.43,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,As you can see, we've taken measures to ensure the energy doesn't leak out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.05,0:08:20.29,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,This is to prevent what took place the other day from happening again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.50,0:08:38.64,Alan,,0,0,0,,Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.21,0:08:53.30,BossgodoraTrainer,,0,0,0,,Bossgodora!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.61,0:08:58.51,Alan,,0,0,0,,Good job lasting this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.79,0:09:02.69,Alan,,0,0,0,,Once we've managed ten victories, there's something I've been thinking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.59,0:09:05.09,Manon,,0,0,0,,Alan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.80,0:09:07.74,Alan,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.73,0:09:09.39,Manon,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "what"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.87,0:09:13.87,Manon,,0,0,0,,Never mind that. Is it true that that you're staking your Key Stone and Mega Stone in the battles?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.11,0:09:14.33,Alan,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.77,0:09:15.41,Manon,,0,0,0,,Why would you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.02,0:09:18.20,Alan,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.89,0:09:23.77,Manon,,0,0,0,,Non, non. Don't get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.27,0:09:28.37,Manon,,0,0,0,,Hey, what about our journey?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.37,0:09:29.87,Alan,,0,0,0,,You just tagged along without asking...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:32.48,Manon,,0,0,0,,When you're there with us, Hari-san and I can become stronger too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.99,0:09:34.73,Manon,,0,0,0,,Let's keep traveling together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.07,0:09:35.60,Alan,,0,0,0,,We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.13,0:09:36.55,Manon,,0,0,0,,Why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:40.37,Alan,,0,0,0,,If you stay with me, you'll just get into danger again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.31,0:09:43.58,Manon,,0,0,0,,But with you by our side, we can make it through!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:48.96,Alan,,0,0,0,,Don't rely on me any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.34,0:09:49.81,Manon,,0,0,0,,Alan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.06,0:09:51.09,Alan,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:54.40,Alan,,0,0,0,,I can't become stronger as long as you're around!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.46,0:10:09.77,Alan,,0,0,0,,You look like you want to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.97,0:10:13.92,Alan,,0,0,0,,This is how it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.33,0:10:25.95,Manon,,0,0,0,,Hari-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.21,0:10:29.53,Manon,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.69,0:11:40.64,MaleScientist,,0,0,0,,Increase the output.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.34,0:11:41.61,FemaleScientist,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.97,0:11:51.98,FemaleScientist,,0,0,0,,There is a response.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.30,0:11:52.81,MaleScientist,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.26,0:11:54.85,MaleScientist,,0,0,0,,Also, change the cycle of the beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.09,0:11:55.33,FemaleScientist,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.17,0:12:04.54,MaleScientist2,,0,0,0,,Zygarde is shrinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.81,0:12:10.78,MaleScientist,,0,0,0,,Change the cycle back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.17,0:12:11.42,FemaleScientist,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.03,0:12:24.80,MaleScientist,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and restore it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.04,0:12:25.33,FemaleScientist,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:41.21,MaleScientist3,,0,0,0,,Where did this guy come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.52,0:12:42.15,Both,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:48.45,MaleScientist3,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:23.50,Alan,,0,0,0,,Dragon Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.06,0:13:41.27,Alan,,0,0,0,,Well done, Lizardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.05,0:13:43.90,Alan,,0,0,0,,Just one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.92,0:13:48.46,Pachira,,0,0,0,,I'm shocked...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.73,0:13:51.35,Pachira,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you actually {\i1}were{\i0} able to defeat nine people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.52,0:13:54.91,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. I'm Pachira.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.47,0:13:57.75,Pachira,,0,0,0,,I shall be your final opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.39,0:13:59.03,Alan,,0,0,0,,Elite Four member...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.58,0:14:00.21,Alan,,0,0,0,,...Pachira.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.86,0:14:02.35,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Oh my, you know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.11,0:14:04.25,Pachira,,0,0,0,,That makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:05.55,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.55,0:14:08.59,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's Manon-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.10,0:14:13.63,Staff1,,0,0,0,,I saw her standing on the battlefield for a while, but then she disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:16.59,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.37,0:14:21.26,Pachira,,0,0,0,,You seem to have lost to Zumi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.03,0:14:22.97,Alan,,0,0,0,,We're different from who we were back then!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.77,0:14:25.44,Alan,,0,0,0,,I have more things to protect now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.49,0:14:27.11,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Hellgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.85,0:14:32.76,Alan,,0,0,0,,A Fire type, huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.24,0:14:35.64,Alan,,0,0,0,,Lizardon, let's show her everything we've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.11,0:14:37.71,Alan,,0,0,0,,Open up the path to being the strongest!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.11,0:14:39.07,Alan,,0,0,0,,Mega evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.72,0:14:51.71,Alan,,0,0,0,,She's worthy of being the final opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.15,0:14:53.11,Alan,,0,0,0,,Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.91,0:15:01.58,Alan,,0,0,0,,Flash Fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.20,0:15:02.76,Pachira,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.40,0:15:05.72,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Flames are meals for this little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.65,0:15:07.87,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Blaze up,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.73,0:15:09.24,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Hellgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.77,0:15:10.78,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Mega evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.57,0:15:27.50,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.95,0:15:37.03,Alan,,0,0,0,,Fly, Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.23,0:15:38.97,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Smog!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:45.94,Alan,,0,0,0,,Reduce it to ashes with Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.11,0:15:51.26,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Using force, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.61,0:15:52.74,Pachira,,0,0,0,,I don't dislike that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.11,0:15:54.36,Alan,,0,0,0,,Steel Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.14,0:15:59.16,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Flick it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:06.21,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Crunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.56,0:16:09.93,Alan,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.00,0:16:17.58,Alan,,0,0,0,,Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.90,0:16:20.47,Pachira,,0,0,0,,You seem to be using Mega Evolution in your aim to become the strongest...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.19,0:16:23.47,Pachira,,0,0,0,,...but what {\i1}is{\i0} Mega Evolution to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.07,0:16:25.48,Alan,,0,0,0,,Why are you asking me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.72,0:16:27.74,Pachira,,0,0,0,,I have an interest in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:29.90,Alan,,0,0,0,,Lizardon, Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.02,0:16:36.74,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Won't you answer me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.34,0:16:38.54,Alan,,0,0,0,,I just want to be strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.03,0:16:40.24,Alan,,0,0,0,,...together with Lizardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.75,0:16:42.83,Pachira,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of strong Pokémon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.59,0:16:45.62,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Why does it have to be Lizardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.28,0:16:48.33,Alan,,0,0,0,,I've walked this path together with Lizardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:50.13,Alan,,0,0,0,,We've fought together...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.91,0:16:52.57,Alan,,0,0,0,,...and aimed for the same destination together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.85,0:16:55.42,Alan,,0,0,0,,I believe in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.34,0:16:58.79,Pachira,,0,0,0,,How straightforward you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.37,0:17:01.02,Pachira,,0,0,0,,No wonder the director likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.64,0:17:02.36,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Dark Pulse!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.16,0:17:05.91,Alan,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.30,0:17:07.61,Alan,,0,0,0,,Dragon Claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.72,0:17:12.47,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Crunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.78,0:17:19.66,Alan,,0,0,0,,Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.78,0:17:19.66,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.03,0:17:28.68,Manon,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:29.62,Manon,,0,0,0,,Hari-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.03,0:17:31.77,Manon,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.01,0:17:32.87,FemaleScientist,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.87,0:17:34.33,Manon,,0,0,0,,Hari-san, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.99,0:17:36.30,Manon,,0,0,0,,What have you done to Hari-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.70,0:17:38.44,MaleScientist,,0,0,0,,Out of the way! We're in a hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.83,0:17:40.46,Manon,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0} get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.46,0:17:41.85,MaleScientist,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.87,0:17:43.64,Daigo,,0,0,0,,Manon-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.17,0:17:45.02,Manon,,0,0,0,,Daigo-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.83,0:17:46.98,Manon,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong with Hari-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.76,0:17:55.29,Alan,,0,0,0,,Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.88,0:17:59.96,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Oh my, you seem to be tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.15,0:18:01.32,Pachira,,0,0,0,,I'll give you some relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.74,0:18:02.53,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Crunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.33,0:18:05.10,Alan,,0,0,0,,Lizardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.61,0:18:06.87,Alan,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.43,0:18:14.06,Alan,,0,0,0,,Blast Burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.59,0:18:28.09,Pachira,,0,0,0,,I can't believe its power...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.36,0:18:39.80,Alan,,0,0,0,,Well done, Lizardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.11,0:18:43.53,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the hard work, Hellgar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.61,0:18:48.14,Pachira,,0,0,0,,You truly are a detestable Trainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.90,0:18:50.58,Pachira,,0,0,0,,So detestable it actually makes me like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.27,0:18:52.60,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Congrats on beating all ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.29,0:18:54.23,Alan,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.76,0:18:57.19,Alan,,0,0,0,,Director...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.83,0:18:59.88,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Defeating Pachira is quite a feat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:02.60,Pachira,,0,0,0,,You sure have shown me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.34,0:19:04.75,Pachira,,0,0,0,,...a bond that exceeded its limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.39,0:19:10.87,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,It means that Mega Evolution can't be achieved by Pokémon alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.53,0:19:11.77,Alan,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.43,0:19:16.15,Alan,,0,0,0,,I realized that it requires us Trainers to have a great resolve as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.49,0:19:19.11,Alan,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.93,0:19:23.63,Alan,,0,0,0,,Now I can protect everything that's important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.91,0:19:27.03,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Oh? And what is it that's important to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.27,0:19:27.69,Staff1,,0,0,0,,Director.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.71,0:19:31.41,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.80,0:19:42.43,Platane,,0,0,0,,Manon-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.97,0:19:43.85,Manon,,0,0,0,,Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:49.55,Manon,,0,0,0,,Joy-san, how is Hari-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.82,0:19:54.81,Joy,,0,0,0,,Its life is not in danger, but I don't know the cause of its comatose state.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.23,0:19:55.93,Manon,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.33,0:19:58.04,Joy,,0,0,0,,Right now there's nothing I can do but watch how things develop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.42,0:20:00.49,Platane,,0,0,0,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.05,0:20:01.75,Manon,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.36,0:20:03.56,Manon,,0,0,0,,I have no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.22,0:20:07.13,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,We'll be keeping Harimaron at the Fleur-de-lis Foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.01,0:20:09.69,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,No facility is better than ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.99,0:20:12.30,Platane,,0,0,0,,You're Director Fleur-de-lis, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.48,0:20:14.65,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.48,0:20:18.94,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,I'll take responsibility for Harimaron and make efforts towards its recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.84,0:20:22.60,Manon,,0,0,0,,Hari-san will be all right, won't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.39,0:20:26.19,Manon,,0,0,0,,It will... It will wake up for sure, won't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.71,0:20:28.51,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Yes. Leave it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.43,0:21:08.25,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,To wake up Harimaron, we need to establish the Mega Evolution energy system as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.57,0:21:09.30,Alan,,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.72,0:21:12.89,Alan,,0,0,0,,I'll do it to save Harimaron, and to bring back Manon's smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.04,0:21:17.35,JuppetaTrainer,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.99,0:21:20.85,JuppetaTrainer,,0,0,0,,That's a Key Stone on your arm, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.48,0:21:23.39,Pachira,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.88,0:21:24.60,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.10,0:21:27.75,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Catching such a pure boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.38,0:21:29.36,Pachira,,0,0,0,,You're a bad man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.82,0:21:31.51,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,I haven't told a single lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.07,0:21:32.94,Pachira,,0,0,0,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.64,0:21:35.80,Pachira,,0,0,0,,I now know the reason you like that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.30,0:21:47.03,Alan,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Manon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.07,0:21:49.82,Alan,,0,0,0,,I'll save Harimaron, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.89,0:21:52.68,Alan,,0,0,0,,So please show me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.43,0:21:54.09,Alan,,0,0,0,,...your smile once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.12,0:21:58.31,Alan,,0,0,0,,Lizardon, Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.59,0:22:03.18,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,This is a story of humans and Pokémon revolving around Mega Evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.97,0:22:06.03,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Those who fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.69,0:22:10.75,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Those who pray...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.06,0:22:15.26,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,Those who investigate...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.77,0:22:19.87,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,And finally, those who change the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.83,0:22:27.93,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,In the near future,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.65,0:22:31.97,Fleur-de-lis,,0,0,0,,the bond between humanity and Pokémon will be put to the test.